        "Primary key": ["Appointment ID"],
        "Foreign key": {
          "Patient ID": {"Patient": "Patient ID"},
          "Doctor ID": {"Doctor": "Doctor ID"}
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "hc_03",
    "domain": "healthcare",
    "requirement": "A system records diagnoses made during encounters. Each encounter has an Encounter ID, Date, and the attending provider. Each diagnosis condition has a Condition Code (ICD-10), Description, and Category. An encounter can result in many diagnoses, and the same condition can be diagnosed across many encounters; for each diagnosis the system stores whether it is the primary diagnosis.",
