    "domain": "healthcare",
    "requirement": "A pharmacy tracks prescriptions. Each patient has a Patient ID and Name. Each drug has a Drug Code, Name, and Unit Price. A prescription is written for one patient and may include several drugs; each prescription has a Prescription ID and Issue Date, and for every drug on it the system records the Dosage and Quantity.",
